        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 18.1 Guardrails & Strict Separation of Powers"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **Zero Verdict Control:** The AI Copilot has **no visual or programmatic controls** to modify the Verdict badge, adjust Risk/Confidence scores, or close tickets."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Mandatory Citation:** Every factual assertion made by the assistant must contain a hyperlinked Evidence ID (`[EVD-***]`)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. **Epistemic Humility:** When asked about missing information (e.g., \"Is the attachment malicious?\"), if the sandbox is pending or incomplete, the assistant states: *\"Sandbox execution data is currently missing or inconclusive [EVD-ATT-001]. No definitive malware determination can be made without payload execution.\"*"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 18.2 Built-in Analyst Query Starters"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- *\"Why is confidence low on this alert?\"*"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- *\"Which single piece of evidence is most critical?\"*"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- *\"What evidence is currently missing or unverified?\"*"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- *\"Show me historical cases sharing this origin ASN.\"*"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- *\"Draft a 3-sentence executive incident notification for the CISO.\"*"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# Error States"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "In high-stakes security operations, silent failures or generic \"Something went wrong\" messages are unacceptable. ASHIELDER communicates technical failures with precision and actionable recovery paths."
