        lines {
          text: "### 24.1 Permission-Aware UI Behavior"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- Prohibited actions are never abruptly hidden without explanation; instead, buttons are rendered in an inactive, disabled state with a clear padlock icon and tooltip:  "
