          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "5. The pipeline re-analyzes the payload; the case updates via Diff Mode to `MALICIOUS` with $96\\%$ Confidence."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# MVP Scope vs Future Scope"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 31.1 MVP Scope (SIH 2026 PS 26106 Target)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Core Triage Inbox:** Virtualized table, multi-parameter filtering, quick-peek slideout drawer."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Case Workspace HUD:** Real-time Verdict, Risk gauge, Confidence meter, and Envelope metadata."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **RFC 5322 Header Forensics:** Complete Received hop visualizer, transit latency delta calculator, and SPF/DKIM/DMARC matrix."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **URL & Domain Analysis:** Defanged link viewer, unshortened redirect chain flow, and homoglyph punycode detection."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Infrastructure & Geolocation:** Origin IP ASN/ISP details and interactive dark-canvas world map route."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Attachment Forensics:** Static metadata, double-extension warning, Shannon entropy gauge, and file hash copying."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Evidence Explorer:** Filterable repository of all `EVD-***` items with one-click deep inspector drawer."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Dedicated Forensic Report View:** In-app report review with explicit visual isolation between System Findings and AI Explanations."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Evidentiary AI Assistant:** Side-dock copilot strictly grounded in Evidence IDs with prompt starters."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **First-Class INCONCLUSIVE State:** Dedicated UI for low-confidence or degraded signal cases."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Sober Cybersecurity Design System:** WCAG AA compliant dark palette, zero neon gradients, full keyboard navigation."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 31.2 Future Scope (Post-Hackathon Enterprise Roadmap)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Automated SOAR Orchestration:** Direct integration with firewall and EDR APIs (CrowdStrike, SentinelOne) for 1-click endpoint isolation."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Graph Neural Network (GNN) Visualizer:** 3D interactive node-graph mapping global relationships between disparate threat actor campaigns."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Hardware YubiKey Signature Signing:** Cryptographic hardware token signing embedded directly into exported forensic reports."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Live Collaborative Workspace:** Real-time multi-analyst cursor presence and shared investigative scratchpads."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# UX Risks & Mitigations"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| UX Risk Factor | Operational Hazard | Client-Side Architectural Mitigation |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| :--- | :--- | :--- |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Automation Bias** | Analysts blindly trusting AI explanations without validating raw evidence. | AI copilot answers are visually isolated, cannot touch verdicts, and must include clickable Evidence IDs linking to raw source bytes. |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Alert Fatigue & Cognitive Blur** | Monotonous dark tables leading to overlooked critical indicators during long shifts. | Multi-density views, strict typographic hierarchy, high-contrast WCAG AA status tokens, and keyboard-driven triage. |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **False Sense of Safety** | Low-confidence or degraded cases mistakenly assumed clean by junior analysts. | Strict **Missing Evidence \342\211\240 Safe** rule; dedicated `INCONCLUSIVE` state with explicit Missing Artifact Checklists. |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Context Switching Friction** | Investigators opening 10 browser tabs to check WHOIS, VirusTotal, and GeoIP. | All essential telemetry is enriched and presented natively in unified, defanged tabbed inspectors. |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Legal Inadmissibility** | Reports challenged in court due to unclear provenance or modified timestamps. | Immutable Evidence ID taxonomy, raw EML hash verification, and strict visual separation of deterministic facts from probabilistic AI text. |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# Final Recommendations"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **Enforce the 5-Second Comprehension Rule:** Ensure that the Case HUD and Key Findings are rendered above the fold with zero layout shift, so an analyst grasps threat nature, risk, and confidence instantaneously."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Never Merge Risk and Confidence:** Maintain the 2D orthogonal display of Risk (Threat Impact) and Confidence (Data Completeness) across all views."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. **Keep AI Subservient to Proof:** Treat AI as an evidentiary clerk, not a judge. Never allow AI to generate ungrounded prose or modify case verdicts."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "4. **Preserve Forensic Provenance:** Ensure every Evidence ID (`EVD-***`) acts as an immutable anchor linking synthesized insights directly to raw RFC 5322 header bytes and payload hashes."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "5. **Maintain Visual Sobriety:** Strictly honor the professional SOC aesthetic\342\200\224prioritizing dark slate neutrals, precise monospace telemetry, and functional contrast over decorative gradients and animations."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "*End of Authoritative Frontend Product Specification \342\200\224 ASHIELDER Workstation (SIH 2026 PS 26106)*"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
