        lines {
          text: "Visualizes each pipeline stage sequentially:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **MIME Ingestion & EML Unpacking:** Verification of file boundary integrity, hashing of raw EML (`SHA-256: 8f4c...`)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **RFC 5322 Header Parser:** Extraction of Received lines, Message-ID validity check, date skew analysis."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. **Cryptographic Identity Verification:** SPF check via DNS, DKIM public key lookup, DMARC policy enforcement, ARC chain validation."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "4. **URL & Domain Extraction:** Defanging, normalization, WHOIS age query, unshortening redirect paths."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "5. **Infrastructure & Geo-IP Enrichment:** Origin IP BGP lookup, ASN reputation scoring, Geo-IP coordinate mapping."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "6. **Attachment Static & Dynamic Detonation:** Antivirus signatures, heuristic macro analysis, sandbox execution telemetry."
