        lines {
          text: "- **File & Function:** `app/api/v1/investigation.py:analyze_email()`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Purpose:** Primary entry point for email triage. Ingests a raw RFC 822/5322 `.eml` file, triggers synchronous multi-level adaptive investigation (L0 deterministic $\\rightarrow$ L1 ML $\\rightarrow$ L2 external enrichment), calculates Risk and Confidence, assigns a Verdict with stop-guards, and persists case artifacts."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Authentication:** `X-API-Key: <SECRET_KEY>` enforced via FastAPI dependency `Depends(verify_api_key)`."
