        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# SECTION 5 \342\200\224 AUTHENTICATION FLOW"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 5.1 Reality of Current Backend Authentication"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The Phase 3 and Phase 4 backend verification confirmed the exact authentication architecture:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **Primary Investigation API (`/api/v1/investigations/*`):**"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - **Mechanism:** `X-API-Key` header compared against `settings.SECRET_KEY`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - **Enforcement:** Applied via FastAPI dependency `Depends(verify_api_key)` across all five investigation endpoints."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - **Behavior:** Missing key $\\rightarrow$ HTTP 401; Incorrect key $\\rightarrow$ HTTP 401; Valid key $\\rightarrow$ Request proceeds."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Email Parse API (`/api/v1/emails/analyze`):**"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - **Mechanism:** Firebase ID Token in `Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - **Enforcement:** Applied via `Depends(verify_token)`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. **RBAC & Multi-User Accounts:**"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - **Status:** \360\237\224\264 **ABSENT IN BACKEND CODEBASE**. There is no `User` model, no role enum, and no permission decorator in the current backend."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 5.2 Frontend Client Auth Architecture"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "To provide a smooth analyst experience without inventing fictional backend routes:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- The frontend provides a clean **API Key Modal / Settings Drawer** where the analyst enters their authorized access key."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- The key is validated by testing `GET /health` followed by a ping or case query."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- Upon receiving an HTTP 401, the client automatically displays the authentication modal and pauses background queries."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- Future multi-user enterprise SSO / RBAC is treated as **Planned / Deferred**; the client shell is designed with permission guards ready to inspect user JWT tokens when the backend introduces them."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "+------------------+         X-API-Key: <SECRET_KEY>        +-----------------------+"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| ASHIELDER Client | \342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200> | FastAPI Ingress       |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "|                  | <\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200 | Depends(verify_api_key)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "+------------------+     200 OK or 401 Unauthorized         +-----------------------+"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# SECTION 6 \342\200\224 CASE LIFECYCLE"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The ASHIELDER backend executes a deterministic, single-request synchronous state machine:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "[UPLOAD] \342\224\200\342\224\200> [PARSER] \342\224\200\342\224\200> [NORMALIZER] \342\224\200\342\224\200> [L0 DETERMINISTIC] \342\224\200\342\224\200> [L1 ML] \342\224\200\342\224\200> [L2 ENRICHMENT] \342\224\200\342\224\200> [RISK/VERDICT] \342\224\200\342\224\200> [PERSIST]"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 6.1 State Machine Lifecycle Table"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| Lifecycle Stage | Backend Event / State | API Response Trigger | Client Visual State | Terminal? | Polling Needed? |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **1. File Selection** | File drop in browser | None (client-side) | Dropzone active, hash preview calculated | No | No |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **2. Upload & Ingest** | `POST /analyze` started | HTTP request pending | Progress bar \"Ingesting MIME payload...\" | No | No |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **3. L0 Forensics** | Level 0 tools running | Synchronous execution | Stepper: \"Parsing RFC 5322 headers & hops...\" | No | No |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **4. L1 ML Analysis** | M2 & M4 models running | Synchronous execution | Stepper: \"Evaluating intent & URL neural net...\" | No | No |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **5. L2 Enrichment** | External feeds queried | Synchronous execution | Stepper: \"Resolving GeoIP, RDAP & history...\" | No | No |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **6. Verdict Assigned** | `RiskEngine.assess()` | Synchronous execution | Stepper: \"Evaluating stop-guards & risk...\" | No | No |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **7. Final Result** | `to_investigation_result` | **HTTP 200 OK (`InvestigationResult`)** | **Case Workspace loaded with full HUD & findings** | **Yes** | **No** |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **8. Re-investigation** | `POST /{id}/reinvestigate` | **HTTP 200 OK (`InvestigationResult`)** | Diff modal loaded, comparison view active | **Yes** | **No** |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 6.2 Polling / WebSocket Reality"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **WebSocket / SSE Support:** \360\237\224\264 **NOT IMPLEMENTED IN BACKEND**."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- The entire adaptive investigation loop executes within the duration of the `POST /api/v1/investigations/analyze` HTTP call (typically 1.2 to 3.5 seconds)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- The client does **not** need complex polling intervals for new cases. It handles the request synchronously with an animated multi-phase investigation loader that tracks expected progress milestones based on typical tool timings."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
