          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **2. Deterministic L0** | `spf_dkim_dmarc`, `header_parse`, `relay_reconstruction`, `url_canonicalizer`, `ip_classifier`, `attachment_hasher`, `deterministic_heuristics` | 40\342\200\223120 ms | `FACT`, `HEURISTIC` (Auth results, Hops, Mismatches) | Missing auth headers flagged as `none` |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **3. Machine Learning L1** | `nlp_intent_ml` (M2 DistilBERT), `url_ml` (M4 LightURLNet) | 120\342\200\223450 ms | `ML_SIGNAL` (Intent, Urgency, URL Threat score) | If model fails $\\rightarrow$ recorded in `tools_failed`, added to `missing_evidence` |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **4. Enrichment L2** | `geoip_lookup`, `rdap_domain_lookup`, `sender_history`, `historical_correlation`, `dns_resolver` | 200\342\200\2231200 ms | `FACT`, `THREAT_INTEL`, `HISTORICAL` (Country, ASN, Prior incidents) | API timeouts degrade gracefully without failing investigation |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **5. Risk & Stop Guard** | `RiskEngine.assess()`, `assign_verdict_with_stop_guard()` | 10\342\200\22325 ms | Final `risk_score`, `confidence`, `verdict` | Budget exhausted $\\rightarrow$ overrides Benign to `INCONCLUSIVE` |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 7.2 Tool Health Status Display"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The UI explicitly tags each tool execution node in the Journey stepper:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **`SUCCESS`:** Tool listed in `tools_used` and generated evidence items."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **`DEGRADED`:** Tool executed but generated missing evidence warnings (e.g., WHOIS rate limit)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **`FAILED`:** Tool listed in `tools_failed` (e.g., `tools_failed: [\"url_ml\"]`)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **`SKIPPED`:** Tool disabled in registry (e.g., `attachment_static_analysis`, `groq_reasoning`)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# SECTION 8 \342\200\224 EVIDENCE MODEL"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The ASHIELDER design philosophy states: **EVIDENCE FIRST**. Every conclusion must link directly to an immutable artifact."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 8.1 Evidence Registry Structure"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "In the backend, all findings are typed instances of `EvidenceItem`. The frontend normalizes these items into a filterable indexed collection:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "EvidenceItem"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 evidence_id     (e.g., \"EVD-AUT-001\")"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 evidence_type   (\"FACT\" | \"HEURISTIC\" | \"ML_SIGNAL\" | \"THREAT_INTEL\" | \"HISTORICAL\")"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 category        (\"AUTHENTICATION\" | \"HEADER\" | \"RELAY\" | \"URL\" | \"ATTACHMENT\")"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 key             (\"auth_dmarc_result\", \"intent_label\", \"reply_to_domain_mismatch\")"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 value           (\"fail\", \"PHISHING\", true)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 source_type     (\"PARSER\", \"HANDLER\", \"ML_MODEL\", \"EXTERNAL_API\", \"LOCAL_DB\")"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 producer        (\"spf_dkim_dmarc\", \"M2IntentClassifier\", \"relay_reconstruction\")"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 provenance      (RFC header line, byte offset, external API endpoint)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 8.2 Frontend Evidence Linking Architecture"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "Whenever the UI displays an insight, it renders an **Evidence Chip** with its ID:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **Key Finding:** `\"DMARC authentication failed: Domain mismatch [EVD-AUT-001]\"`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Click Event:** Clicking `[EVD-AUT-001]` triggers the **Evidence Explorer** slideout drawer."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. **Provenance Inspection:** The drawer highlights:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Extracted Value: `dmarc=fail (p=reject)`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Producer: `spf_dkim_dmarc v2.2.0`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Provenance: RFC 5322 header `Authentication-Results: mx.targetcorp.in; dmarc=fail...`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Action: `[View in Raw Headers]` button jumps directly to the highlighted line in the raw header inspector."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# SECTION 9 \342\200\224 RISK / CONFIDENCE / VERDICT"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The ASHIELDER frontend strictly maintains the **2D Risk-Confidence separation**. Risk and Confidence are never combined into a single score."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 9.1 Backend Mathematical Semantics"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "+\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200+"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| RISK SCORE: [ 0.0 to 100.0 ]                                                  |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| Calculated via EVIDENCE_WEIGHTS table in app/services/risk/scoring.py         |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| \342\200\242 Sum of weighted evidence items with category caps applied.                  |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| \342\200\242 Deterministic, bounded, positive indicators.                                |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "+\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200+"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| CONFIDENCE SCORE: [ 0.0 to 1.0 ]                                              |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| Calculated via app/services/risk/confidence.py                                |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| Formula: completeness \303\227 reliability \303\227 conflict_factor \303\227 failure_factor         |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| \342\200\242 Completeness: Ratio of tools executed vs candidates.                        |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| \342\200\242 Historical Cap: If only historical evidence is strong, capped at 0.70.     |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "+\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200+"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 9.2 Exact Verdict Matrix Enforced by Backend (`verdict.py`)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| Condition | Verdict | UI Visual Treatment |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| :--- | :--- | :--- |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| $\\text{Confidence} < 0.35$ | **`INCONCLUSIVE`** | Slate Blue Badge, Caution Icon, Missing Evidence Banner |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| $\\text{Risk} \\ge 75$ AND $\\text{Confidence} \\ge 0.60$ | **`MALICIOUS`** | Crimson Red Badge, Shield Alert Icon |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| $\\text{Risk} \\ge 40$ AND $\\text{Confidence} \\ge 0.50$ | **`SUSPICIOUS`** | Amber Orange Badge, Alert Triangle Icon |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| $\\text{Risk} < 40$ AND $\\text{Confidence} \\ge 0.60$ | **`BENIGN`** | Emerald Green Badge, Check Circle Icon |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| Resource Stop Guard (Budget Exhausted / Tool Failure) AND Verdict would be `BENIGN` | **`INCONCLUSIVE`** | **CRITICAL:** Resource exhaustion forces Inconclusive (never Benign) |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The frontend directly binds to `result.verdict` and **never** re-calculates or overrides the backend verdict."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# SECTION 10 \342\200\224 AI COPILOT INTEGRATION"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 10.1 Backend Reality of AI Reasoning"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Level 3 Tool (`groq_reasoning`):** \360\237\224\264 **DISABLED IN BACKEND PIPELINE** (no handler verified)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Report Enrichment (`GET /report`):** \360\237\237\241 **PARTIALLY IMPLEMENTED**. The backend checks `GROQ_API_KEY`. If configured, it populates `groq_narrative`; if missing, it sets `groq_status: \"GROQ_UNAVAILABLE\"` and returns a deterministic narrative summary generated from rules."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Interactive Chat Endpoint (`/chat` or `/copilot`):** \360\237\224\264 **NOT IMPLEMENTED IN BACKEND**."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 10.2 Frontend Copilot Architecture (Safe, Evidence-Grounded Assistant)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "To deliver the required AI Copilot experience without inventing unverified server endpoints:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **Evidence-Grounded Query Engine:**"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - The Copilot operates as a client-side evidentiary assistant."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - When the analyst asks a question (e.g., *\"Why is this email suspicious?\"* or *\"What evidence is strongest?\"*), the assistant evaluates the loaded `EvidenceItem` array and `InvestigationResult` data directly."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Every answer cites exact Evidence IDs (`[EVD-HDR-001]`, `[EVD-AUT-002]`)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Strict Security Boundaries:**"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - The Copilot is **read-only**."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - It possesses **zero controls** to alter Risk, Confidence, or Verdict."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - It cannot invoke backend mutation endpoints."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# SECTION 11 \342\200\224 REPORTING"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 11.1 Backend Report Capabilities (`GET /api/v1/investigations/{id}/report`)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The backend provides a structured JSON report endpoint that aggregates:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- Case summary & envelope metadata"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- Evidence items classified by type (`FACT`, `HEURISTIC`, `ML_SIGNAL`, `THREAT_INTEL`)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- Deterministic narrative summary of the threat"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- Geolocation & content analysis blocks"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- Cryptographic audit chain validation (`chain_length`, `last_hash`, `tamper_detected`)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 11.2 Frontend Report Experience & PDF Generation"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Interactive Report View:** Visualizes the report with executive briefing sections, evidence tables, and signature stamps."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Client-Side PDF Generation:** Since the backend does not offer a direct binary PDF export endpoint, the frontend provides an optimized **Print Stylesheet** (`@media print`) and client-side PDF renderer that outputs clean, court-ready forensic reports directly to paper or PDF format."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# SECTION 12 \342\200\224 REAL ERROR / DEGRADED STATES"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The ASHIELDER frontend handles every real failure mode observed in the backend runtime matrix:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| Failure Mode | Backend Signal | UI Representation | Recovery Action | Risk Impact | Confidence Impact |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Malformed .EML** | `400 Bad Request` | \"Invalid RFC 822/5322 MIME format\" | Prompt user to verify `.eml` export | None (rejected) | None |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Empty File** | `400 Bad Request` | \"Uploaded file is 0 bytes\" | Re-select non-empty file | None (rejected) | None |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Payload > 10MB** | `413 Payload Too Large` | \"File exceeds 10 MB limit\" | Advise stripping large benign attachments | None (rejected) | None |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Invalid API Key** | `401 Unauthorized` | Auth Drawer opens automatically | Enter valid `X-API-Key` | None | None |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Rate Limit Exceeded** | `429 Too Many Requests` | Cooldown timer banner (60s countdown) | Automatic retry after cooldown | None | None |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **ML Model Unavailable** | `tools_failed: [\"url_ml\"]` | Warning icon on URL card: \"ML Model Offline\" | Investigation continues via heuristics | Preserved | Reduced by failure factor |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **DNS / WHOIS Timeout** | `missing_evidence: [\"Tool rdap...\"]` | Degraded tag on Domain Card | Offer manual external WHOIS link | Preserved | Reduced by missing signals |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Budget Exhaustion** | `stop_reason: \"BUDGET_EXHAUSTED\"` | Amber Warning: \"Investigation Terminated on Budget\" | Offer \"Re-investigate with high budget\" | Preserved | Capped $\\rightarrow$ Forces INCONCLUSIVE |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **DB Unreachable** | `500` or silent bypass | Offline Storage Banner: \"Saving to Local Cache\" | Results preserved in browser storage | None | None |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Inconclusive Result** | `verdict: \"INCONCLUSIVE\"` | Specialized Inconclusive Workspace HUD | Displays Missing Evidence Checklist | Stays low | Stays $< 0.35$ |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "**Fundamental Axiom:** **MISSING EVIDENCE $\\neq$ SAFE.** A tool failure or timeout never causes a verdict to become `BENIGN`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# SECTION 13 \342\200\224 LOADING / POLLING / REAL-TIME"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 13.1 Real-Time Execution Reality"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- Backend execution is **synchronous**: The `POST /api/v1/investigations/analyze` endpoint holds the connection open until all enabled investigation tools complete (average duration: 1.8s, worst-case: 4.2s)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **WebSockets / Server-Sent Events (SSE):** \360\237\224\264 **NONE PRESENT IN BACKEND**."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 13.2 Frontend Loading Strategy"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "During the 1.5\342\200\2234.0 second synchronous request:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **Multi-Stage Progress Indicator:** The UI transitions through expected milestones based on typical tool timings:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `0.0s \342\200\223 0.3s:` \"Ingesting MIME envelope and calculating cryptographic hashes...\""
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `0.3s \342\200\223 0.8s:` \"Parsing RFC 5322 headers, Received hops & authentication records...\""
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `0.8s \342\200\223 1.8s:` \"Executing DistilBERT intent classification & LightURLNet...\""
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `1.8s \342\200\223 2.8s:` \"Enriching autonomous system, GeoIP, and historical telemetry...\""
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `2.8s+:` \"Evaluating risk score, confidence bounds & stop conditions...\""
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Timeout Safeguard:** If no response returns after 10 seconds, the client aborts with a graceful error and provides troubleshooting advice."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# SECTION 14 \342\200\224 SECURITY BOUNDARY"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The client-side workstation adheres to rigorous cybersecurity operational security (OPSEC) rules:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **Defanged Links by Default:** All extracted URLs are rendered defanged (`hxxp://`, `example[.]com`, `[dot]`). The client **never** automatically issues HTTP pre-fetch or preview queries to target URLs."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Sanitized HTML Body Rendering:** Raw HTML email bodies are sanitized using strict DOMPurify policies or displayed inside sandboxed `<iframe>` elements (`sandbox=\"allow-same-origin\"` without `allow-scripts` or `allow-forms`) to prevent stored cross-site scripting (XSS) or tracking pixel triggers."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. **No Secret Key Exposure:** Backend provider secrets (Groq keys, VirusTotal keys, AbuseIPDB keys, database connection strings) remain strictly server-side. The frontend only handles the single `X-API-Key` client credential."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "4. **Immutable Evidence Records:** The frontend treats all received `EvidenceItem` records as read-only. It provides no UI mechanism to edit, delete, or fabricate evidence artifacts."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "5. **No Blind Trust in AI Text:** AI-generated narrative text is visually demarcated with distinct styling, indicating that it is a synthesized interpretation and never direct system evidence."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# SECTION 15 \342\200\224 BACKEND GAPS (ASHIELDER_FRONTEND_BACKEND_GAPS)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "This section inventories the technical discrepancies between the idealized Stage 1 Product Specification and the actual backend capabilities."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| Feature | Missing Backend API / Data | Reason Frontend Needs It | Priority | Recommended Backend Contract | Required for SIH MVP? |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Global Case Inbox** | `GET /api/v1/investigations` | Required to display the triage list of all prior cases. | **P0** | `GET /api/v1/investigations?limit=50&offset=0&verdict=MALICIOUS` returning list of case summaries. | \360\237\237\241 High (Simulated via client cache for demo) |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Raw EML Preservation** | `GET /api/v1/investigations/{id}/raw` | Needed so the analyst can download or view the unparsed original `.eml` bytes. | **P1** | Endpoint returning `message/rfc822` binary stream from Supabase Storage. | \342\232\252 No (SHA-256 hash is sufficient for triage) |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Multi-User RBAC** | User roles, JWT tokens, `/api/v1/auth/login` | Required for role-based permissions (L1 Analyst vs Forensic Lead). | **P1** | User authentication service with JWT claims (`role: \'soc_l1\' \\| \'soc_lead\'`). | \342\232\252 No (Single shared API key works for Hackathon demo) |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Interactive AI Chat** | `POST /api/v1/investigations/{id}/chat` | Needed for multi-turn conversational Q&A with LLM. | **P2** | `POST /chat` accepting query string + evidence context, streaming response. | \342\232\252 No (Client-side evidence query engine satisfies triage) |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Deep Attachment Sandbox** | `attachment_static_analysis` handler | Needed for dynamic execution graphs and dropped file hashes. | **P2** | Enable handler in tool registry connecting to sandbox service. | \342\232\252 No (Static SHA-256 and MIME detection is operational) |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **PDF Binary Report Export** | `GET /api/v1/investigations/{id}/report.pdf` | Needed for 1-click legal PDF download. | **P3** | Server-side WeasyPrint/Headless Chrome endpoint. | \342\232\252 No (Browser print stylesheet satisfies export) |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
