        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "This inventory catalog represents the complete, verified surface of the ASHIELDER backend API (`app/main.py`, `app/api/v1/investigation.py`, `app/api/v1/email.py`). Every endpoint, path parameter, header, request schema, and response contract reflects the actual runtime behavior verified during Phase 4 validation."
