          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **EP-02** | Analyze Email (Investigation) | `POST` | `/api/v1/investigations/analyze` | `X-API-Key` | Yes (10/min) | \342\234\205 CONFIRMED |"
