        lines {
          text: "#### EP-02: Analyze Email (Full Forensic Investigation)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Path:** `POST /api/v1/investigations/analyze`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **File & Function:** `app/api/v1/investigation.py:analyze_email()`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Purpose:** Primary entry point for email triage. Ingests a raw RFC 822/5322 `.eml` file, triggers synchronous multi-level adaptive investigation (L0 deterministic $\\rightarrow$ L1 ML $\\rightarrow$ L2 external enrichment), calculates Risk and Confidence, assigns a Verdict with stop-guards, and persists case artifacts."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Authentication:** `X-API-Key: <SECRET_KEY>` enforced via FastAPI dependency `Depends(verify_api_key)`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Required Headers:**"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  - `X-API-Key`: Secret API key matching backend `settings.SECRET_KEY`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  - `Content-Type`: `multipart/form-data`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  - `X-Request-ID` (Optional but recommended): Client-generated UUIDv4 for distributed tracing."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Request Body (Multipart Form):**"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  - `file`: Binary file stream of the `.eml` email message."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  - **Validation Constraints:** Filename required (must end with `.eml` or be valid MIME), body cannot be 0 bytes, maximum size limit enforced at 10 MB (10,485,760 bytes)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Response Schema (`InvestigationResult` contract from `app/contracts/result.py`):**"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  ```json"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
